{
  "name": "dsh-session-plus",
  "version": "0.6.0",
  "description": "会话增强插件：模型选择菜单顶部实时展示当前模型提供商名称；聊天页选中文本可一键以代码块形式加入输入框开头；账户菜单顶部提供「跟随系统 / 浅色 / 深色」主题快捷切换（Rubber Segment 动效）；官方模型菜单「推理等级」一行改造为 Codex 风格连续滑条（一档一色 + 最高档能量层）。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "scripts": {
    "test": "node --test test/*.test.mjs"
  },
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./client": {
      "default": "./lib/client.js"
    },
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-locale",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-slots",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-model-selection"
      ],
      "platform": "web"
    }
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README_en.md",
    "README.md",
    "CHANGELOG.md",
    "NOTICE.md"
  ],
  "license": "MIT"
}
